By "registry ID," I mean the unique identifier assigned to each maintenance record when it's created in our system. This is the internal ID that tracks each individual maintenance entry in our database, not an external registration reference. This identifier helps us uniquely identify and reference each maintenance record in our equipment maintenance tracking system.

